  "notes": [
    "Compound of *tener* — follows the same irregular patterns throughout",
    "Irregular yo present: *sostengo* (go-verb)",
    "e→ie stem change in present: tú/él/ellos forms (sostienes, sostiene, sostienen); nosotros keeps *sostene-*",
    "Irregular preterite stem: *sostuv-* (sostuve, sostuviste, sostuvo, sostuvimos, sostuvieron)",
    "Irregular future/conditional stem: *sostendr-* (sostendré, sostendría)",
    "Subjuntivo/imperativo from yo stem: *sosteng-* (sostenga, sostengas...); tú affirmative imperative is the short irregular form *sostén* (like tener→ten, mantener→mantén)",
    "Past participle: *sostenido*",
    "Common usage: *sostener un objeto* (to hold an object), *sostener una conversación* (to hold/have a conversation), *sostener una opinión* (to hold/maintain an opinion), *sostener a la familia* (to support the family, financially)"
